Place hierarchy

Derived from the UN Standard Country or Area Codes for Statistical Use (M49),
https://unstats.un.org/unsd/methodology/m49/ , joined to ISO 3166-1 alpha-2.
Codes and containment are factual data from those standards rather than a copy
of anyone's compilation, so no licence notice is required for them; the source
is named because knowing where a fact came from is worth more than the notice
would be.
